  <body>
    <h1>Riverside Bakery</h1>
    <p>You will find us on the Rue des Fleurs.</p>
    <p>Our motto is plus de beurre.</p>
    <p>Croeso i''r becws.</p>
  </body>
</html>', '<html lang="en-GB">
